{% block email_body %}{% block email_hello %}
        Dear ClimMob administrator,
    {% endblock email_hello %}{% block email_message %}
        You are receiving this email because a user is requesting a new technology for ClimMob library.

        Below is the information for your respective coordination:

        Person who made the request: {{ user_fullname }}
        ClimMob's user: {{ user_name }}
